{
  "full_prompt_html": "<p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 9pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 54, 52);\">Act as a senior delivery director, a project recovery specialist and a client relationship lead.</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 9pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 54, 52);\">One of our client projects is behind schedule. Help me decide how to recover it. [Paste the project plan or milestone list, the current status, the budget used to date, and any recent status reports or client emails.] [State the fixed constraints: contract end date, budget cap or named deliverables.]</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 9pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 54, 52);\">Work through the decision in four parts:</span></p>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 6pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(34, 31, 31);\"><b>1. Diagnose the Delay</b></span></p>\n<ul data-editing-info=\"{&quot;applyListStyleFromLevel&quot;:true}\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 54, 52); margin: 0in 0in 6pt;\">\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 6pt;\">\nState how far behind the project is against the plan, in days and in budget.</div>\n</li><li style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 54, 52); margin: 0in 0in 6pt;\">\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 6pt;\">\nIdentify the root causes: scope growth, unclear requirements, client dependencies, resourcing or estimation errors.</div>\n</li><li style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 54, 52); margin: 0in 0in 6pt;\">\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 6pt;\">\nSeparate the causes we control from the causes the client controls.</div>\n</li></ul>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 6pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(34, 31, 31);\"><b>2. Lay Out the Options</b></span></p>\n<ul data-editing-info=\"{&quot;applyListStyleFromLevel&quot;:true}\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 54, 52); margin: 0in 0in 6pt;\">\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 6pt;\">\nDescribe at least three recovery options, for example adding people, cutting or phasing scope, extending the date, or changing the delivery approach.</div>\n</li><li style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 54, 52); margin: 0in 0in 6pt;\">\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 6pt;\">\nFor each option, state the effect on date, cost, quality and team workload, with numbers where the data allows.</div>\n</li><li style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 54, 52); margin: 0in 0in 6pt;\">\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 6pt;\">\nNote what each option requires from the client.</div>\n</li></ul>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 6pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(34, 31, 31);\"><b>3. Recommend One Option</b></span></p>\n<ul data-editing-info=\"{&quot;applyListStyleFromLevel&quot;:true}\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 54, 52); margin: 0in 0in 6pt;\">\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 6pt;\">\nRecommend the option that best fits the fixed constraints, and state why in two sentences.</div>\n</li><li style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 54, 52); margin: 0in 0in 6pt;\">\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 6pt;\">\nList the three biggest risks of that option and how to reduce each one.</div>\n</li><li style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 54, 52); margin: 0in 0in 6pt;\">\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 6pt;\">\nDefine the signals that will show within two weeks whether the recovery is working.</div>\n</li></ul>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 6pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(34, 31, 31);\"><b>4. Prepare the Client Conversation</b></span></p>\n<ul data-editing-info=\"{&quot;applyListStyleFromLevel&quot;:true}\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 54, 52); margin: 0in 0in 6pt;\">\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 6pt;\">\nDraft the key message to the client: what happened, what we propose, and what we need from them.</div>\n</li><li style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 54, 52); margin: 0in 0in 6pt;\">\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 6pt;\">\nAnticipate the client’s two hardest questions and give a direct answer to each.</div>\n</li></ul>\n<p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 9pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 54, 52);\">Deliver an options table with columns for Option, Date Impact, Cost Impact, Risk and Client Ask, followed by the recommendation, the two-week signals and the client message in no more than 150 words.</span></p>",
  "n": 8,
  "subject_area": "Client delivery",
  "summary": "Recover a late project by diagnosing causes, comparing options on date, cost and risk, and preparing the client conversation.",
  "title": "Decide how to recover a late-running client project"
}
